-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1107: a WITHIN counted OF a named date is worked out as
-- its literal twin is. The traces start at a date serial, as a date anchor
-- needs.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF Alice
DECLARE Act IS ONE OF pay

`the kickoff` MEANS YMD 2026 7 1

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Act
`dated` MEANS PARTY Alice MUST pay WITHIN 14 OF `the kickoff` LEST BREACH BY Alice BECAUSE "late"

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Act
`dated literal` MEANS PARTY Alice MUST pay WITHIN 14 OF YMD 2026 7 1 LEST BREACH BY Alice BECAUSE "late"

#TRACE `dated` AT DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 6 20) WITH
#TRACE `dated literal` AT DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 6 20) WITH
